+Implementation of function.prototype.bind
+
+Old versions of phantomjs, Internet Explorer < 9, and node < 0.6 don't support `Function.prototype.bind`.
+
+## Example
+
+```js
+Function.prototype.bind = require("function-bind")
+```
+
+## Installation
